WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.818
In under two minutes, you will vote for your favorite homes in a neighborhood contest.

00:00:04.818 --> 00:00:05.834
We start on the map.

00:00:06.733 --> 00:00:10.019
Open your web browser, and go to SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:11.878 --> 00:00:14.309
This is the SoCal Lights home page.

00:00:14.309 --> 00:00:16.808
A message asks to use your location.

00:00:16.808 --> 00:00:18.159
Tap Use my location.

00:00:19.938 --> 00:00:22.307
Your browser asks for permission.

00:00:22.307 --> 00:00:23.003
Tap Allow.

00:00:26.006 --> 00:00:28.372
Look at the top right corner of the map.

00:00:28.372 --> 00:00:29.527
See the three dots?

00:00:29.527 --> 00:00:30.046
Tap them.

00:00:31.881 --> 00:00:33.774
In the menu, tap Contests.

00:00:35.498 --> 00:00:37.107
Under Live now, tap Vote.

00:00:37.107 --> 00:00:39.954
The first time, the site asks you to sign in.

00:00:39.954 --> 00:00:42.244
That keeps it to one vote per person.

00:00:44.205 --> 00:00:45.819
Want to see the homes first?

00:00:45.819 --> 00:00:49.379
Visit the homes splits them into routes of nine stops or fewer.

00:00:49.379 --> 00:00:54.109
Each route starts where the last one ended, and you can tick off each home as you go.

00:00:55.010 --> 00:00:56.916
Every home is in every category.

00:00:56.916 --> 00:00:59.631
In Best Traditional, tap Vote on your favorite.

00:01:01.589 --> 00:01:03.725
The next category opens by itself.

00:01:03.725 --> 00:01:06.349
Tap Vote on your favorite creative display.

00:01:08.275 --> 00:01:09.844
Last, Best Animated.

00:01:09.844 --> 00:01:11.189
Tap your favorite.

00:01:13.566 --> 00:01:14.595
Thanks for voting!

00:01:14.595 --> 00:01:17.086
You can change your vote until voting closes.

00:01:17.086 --> 00:01:19.685
Tap Share this contest to send it to a neighbor.

00:01:21.412 --> 00:01:23.548
Next up: Judge a contest.
